---
// Transcripts + Claude-generated summaries. Three rows that show how
// Whisper + Claude pull a paragraph of meaning out of files that were
// previously silent on the desk. Each card shows: filename / duration /
// bucket, a transcript excerpt, and the catalog's auto-summary.
//
// The summaries are real-vibe Claude outputs from actual catalog rows.
// The point of the component isn't to argue features — it's to show
// that the engine returns *characters* not just classifications.

const ROWS = [
  {
    title: "rainforest_post_karoke",
    ext: ".als",
    duration: "47:08",
    bucket: "JAM",
    tagColor: "yellow",
    transcript:
      "ok, ok so the bass is doing the thing where it loops a fifth and a sub-octave… yeah that’s good. that’s good. who has the kick. is anyone on kick? someone’s on kick. iguanas are NOT a chord progression, Marcus.",
    summary:
      "Five musicians; none of them know what reverb is for the first 22 minutes. The bassist locks into a groove around minute 31; everyone gets it together for ~90 seconds; then someone mentions iguanas and they never recover. Two genuinely good 16-bar sections worth pulling.",
    flags: ["loop-candidate · 31:14 → 31:46", "loop-candidate · 38:02 → 38:30"],
  },
  {
    title: "driving_fast_so_i_dont_drown",
    ext: ".wav",
    duration: "1:48",
    bucket: "VOICE-NOTE",
    tagColor: "cyan",
    transcript:
      "wait wait wait wait wait. maybe if I just stop pretending. that’s it. that’s the— no the chorus is doing too much work. the chorus is— you know what no the verse. the verse is the chorus. shit. semi truck. shit.",
    summary:
      "First-person, anxious, two minutes of stream-of-consciousness while passing a semi truck. Roughly 12 distinct ideas, each one abandoned for the next within four seconds. The phrase “maybe if I just stop pretending” surfaces twice. Songwriting flag: high.",
    flags: ["lyric-fragment · 0:38", "lyric-fragment · 1:21", "songwriting"],
  },
  {
    title: "VOX_Tolo_0007",
    ext: ".wav",
    duration: "0:30",
    bucket: "VOICE-NOTE",
    tagColor: "pink",
    transcript:
      "ok so. what if the chorus, like, doesn’t come back. like. you write it, you sing it once. and then you just… leave. you leave it hanging. is that— is that a thing.",
    summary:
      "30 seconds, conspiratorial tone. A small theory about choruses: maybe they’re supposed to leave you hanging. Worth tagging “structure-experiment” — there are six other memos in the catalog testing variations of this idea.",
    flags: ["idea-fragment", "structure-experiment", "first-person"],
  },
];
---

<div class="ts-stack">
  {ROWS.map((r) => (
    <article class={`ts-card ts-acc-${r.tagColor}`}>
      <header class="ts-card-head">
        <h4 class="ts-card-title">
          <span class="ts-card-stem">{r.title}</span><span class="ts-card-ext">{r.ext}</span>
        </h4>
        <span class="ts-card-meta"><span class="ts-card-dur">{r.duration}</span> · <span class="ts-card-bucket">{r.bucket}</span></span>
      </header>

      <div class="ts-row ts-row-transcript">
        <span class="ts-lbl">TRANSCRIPT · WHISPER</span>
        <p class="ts-transcript">{r.transcript}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ts-row ts-row-summary">
        <span class="ts-lbl ts-lbl-claude">SUMMARY · CLAUDE</span>
        <p class="ts-summary">{r.summary}</p>
      </div>

      <ul class="ts-flags">
        {r.flags.map((f) => <li>{f}</li>)}
      </ul>
    </article>
  ))}
</div>

<style>
  .ts-stack {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .ts-card {
    background: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid var(--cs-line);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--brand-orange);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .ts-acc-yellow { border-left-color: var(--brand-yellow); }
  .ts-acc-cyan { border-left-color: var(--brand-cyan); }
  .ts-acc-pink { border-left-color: var(--brand-pink); }

  .ts-card-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .ts-card-title {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 15.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--brand-green);
    background: rgba(0, 255, 77, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 77, 0.28);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    margin: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .ts-card-ext {
    opacity: 0.48;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 0.78em;
    color: #f5f1e8;
  }
  .ts-card-meta {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.62);
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }
  .ts-card-dur {
    color: var(--brand-pink);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .ts-card-bucket {
    color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.48);
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  }

  .ts-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .ts-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 6px; }
  }

  .ts-lbl {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.20em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.45);
    padding-top: 3px;
  }
  .ts-lbl-claude {
    color: var(--brand-cyan);
  }

  .ts-transcript {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.62);
    margin: 0 !important;
    max-width: none !important;
  }

  .ts-summary {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--cs-text);
    margin: 0 !important;
    max-width: none !important;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    background: rgba(14, 196, 252, 0.04);
    border-left: 2px solid rgba(14, 196, 252, 0.45);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .ts-flags {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 2px 0 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .ts-flags li {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.72);
    padding: 3px 8px;
    background: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid var(--cs-line);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
</style>
